tps://api.github.com/users/omachala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omachala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omachala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omachala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omachala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omachala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omachala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omachala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T19:25:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T19:25:33Z","body":"Hi! I can help update these documentation screenshots.\n\nI maintain [heroshot](https://heroshot.sh), a screenshot automation tool that captures screenshots from a config file using Playwright. This makes it easy to regenerate them when the UI changes.\n\nHappy to submit a PR with updated screenshots!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3843213332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3843478306","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112495#issuecomment-3843478306","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112495","id":3843478306,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lFtMi","user":{"login":"PhairZ","id":123702514,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1-M8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123702514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T20:25:31Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T20:25:31Z","body":"> I maintain [heroshot](https://heroshot.sh)\n\nThanks for the suggestion. From my super quick glance at your project this seems like it only works for web apps (correct me if I'm wrong). Godot isn't a web app, it is an engine built in C++ with a custom UI rendered. AFAIK there's no real way to pick the UI as one does in the browser without modules.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3843478306/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3969793004","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112495#issuecomment-3969793004","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112495","id":3969793004,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7snjvs","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url